classDiagram
    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +int age
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +get_info() str
        +add_task(task) None
        +get_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str description
        +time time
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +str priority
        +int duration_minutes
        +date scheduled_date
        +complete_task() None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +add_task(pet, task) None
        +sort_by_time(tasks) list~Task~
        +_sort_tasks(tasks) list~Task~
        +schedule_tasks() list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(completed, pet_name) list~Task~
        +get_tasks_by_pet(pet_name) list~Task~
        +get_todays_tasks() list~Task~
        +get_pending_tasks() list~Task~
        +mark_task_complete(task) Task
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" o-- "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : manages
    Scheduler ..> Pet : schedules tasks for
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts and checks
